<title>CANADA: Asia Pacific holders okay rights plan.</title>
<headline>Asia Pacific holders okay rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Resources Ltd said on Tuesday shareholders approved a shareholder rights plan at the annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
